  "title": "The Yang-Mills mass gap on R4 is ill-posed and automatic on a compact manifold",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "0cb2c854-d635-4be3-abbb-be5e0620e475",
      "text": "On non-compact $\\mathbb{R}^4$, satisfying the Osterwalder-Schrader axioms and producing a mass gap $\\Delta > 0$ are mutually exclusive within the standard constructive apparatus, shown by four methods. On the compact constructible manifold $M_{\\mathrm{tot}} = S^4 \\times T^3$ over $K$ the gap follows from spectral geometry.",
